      "fact": "Donald Trump Jr. had provided testimony to congressional intelligence and judiciary committees regarding the June 2016 Trump Tower meeting, with transcripts of his September 2017 interview released in May 2018.",
      "source_date": "2018-05-01"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "fact": "Donald Trump Jr.'s lawyer, Alan Futerfas, stated in August 2018 that the family was confident in the accuracy of the information Trump Jr. had provided to investigators.",
